Subject: [PATCH] feat(guide): playbook v2/v3 rewritten for a junior PM

After a read-through as a new junior project manager: what Aurelia is
and what participants do, who's who, the questionnaires in plain words,
a worked example of reading the finish line, the safety trigger in plain
words, what to say when, a glossary, the first week on the job, the
message channel, and who decides in week 9. v3 stays one page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
